tore_item_assets/steam/apps/2873810/extras/176e7203738aed228204aa0991ddfd70.poster.avif?t=1770907424\" width=780 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873810/extras/176e7203738aed228204aa0991ddfd70.webm?t=1770907424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873810/extras/176e7203738aed228204aa0991ddfd70.mp4?t=1770907424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultra-Realistic Rendering:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using Unreal Engine 5 and a vast library of scanned assets, the game brings a highly immersive, hyper-realistic Chinese retro-horror environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fragmented Scene-Based Storytelling:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover connections between anomalies, and peel back the layers of mystery surrounding the stories of the fourth-floor residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beyond “Spot the Difference”:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to pass through? The deep-dwelling residents of the fourth floor have their own rules…</p>",
